    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43313" root="لطف" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَفَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A present;</i> i. e. <i>a thing sent to another
in token of courtesy or honour;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَدِيَّةٌ</span>; (S,
K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَفٌ</span></b> , as stated by Z and others:
pl. of the latter <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْطَافٌ</span>. (TA.)

